No test moved file: the app crate keeps its unit tests in
crates/app/src/app/tests/*.rs, which are child modules of crate::app and
therefore still see the moved methods -- pub(super) on a method in
app::demo_hooks is visible throughout the app subtree, app::tests
included. So R7's 'any inline test that exercises a moved method goes to
the module's own #[cfg(test)]' had nothing to move: app.rs holds no
inline test of its own, only 'mod tests;' at its foot, and none of the
twelve test files is per-method. Splitting them by the four new modules
would have been a second refactor of somebody else's file.

The one change under app/tests/ is the DrawingsDemo binding in mod.rs;
see moved-diff.log.
